Rāma meets raining trees and stones with arrows --- Dūṣaṇa rushes Rāma swinging goldbound iron club --- Rāma severs both jeweled arms and Dūṣaṇa falls --- Beings applaud while three chiefs rush together --- Rāma beheads Mahākapāla blinds Sthūlākṣa crushes Pramāthī --- Rāma reaps remaining army with fiery gold arrows --- Fourteen thousand lie slain by Rāma alone on foot --- Khara charges Rāma like Indra raising thunderbolt